WEBVTT

01:48.960 --> 01:50.280
- Catch her.
- Yes.

01:50.360 --> 01:51.400
Follow me.

02:09.919 --> 02:10.880
Your Highness.

02:22.280 --> 02:24.160
It really is the antidote.

02:24.240 --> 02:27.720
Jinghe, your plan failed again.

04:37.400 --> 04:39.840
There's one incense stick of time.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.640
Your Majesty,

04:44.120 --> 04:44.960
we're running out of time.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.040
Please wake up, Your Majesty!

05:06.240 --> 05:08.160
No need to struggle, Beauty.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.680
I won't kill you.

05:14.960 --> 05:16.360
One incense stick of time.

05:17.320 --> 05:18.680
I can't fall yet.

06:38.520 --> 06:40.440
She can't get far. Go after her!

07:10.840 --> 07:11.800
My lord.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.400
- My lord.
- Where are the leeches?

07:13.480 --> 07:15.760
My lord, the leeches are dead.

07:19.200 --> 07:22.600
It seems only the Snow Dragon Whisker
can neutralize the poison.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.800
My lord.

07:26.720 --> 07:28.760
Mei Lin has left Fanghua Palace.
The Crown Prince spotted her.

09:51.920 --> 09:53.040
Your Majesty.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.280
Your Majesty, I beg you, please wake up!

09:56.360 --> 09:58.360
Time is running out.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.640
Your Majesty.

10:02.720 --> 10:05.800
Your Majesty, I beg you! Please wake up.

10:25.080 --> 10:26.680
Your Highness, is something wrong?

10:28.840 --> 10:29.680
It's nothing.

10:30.320 --> 10:32.880
I just knocked over the candlestick,

10:32.960 --> 10:35.280
restless seeing the Emperor
neither eat nor drink.

10:37.640 --> 10:38.600
How dare you!

10:39.760 --> 10:41.320
Are you trying to enter
the private chamber without permission?

10:42.880 --> 10:43.840
I dare not, Your Highness.

11:05.800 --> 11:08.160
Your Highness, I failed in my duty.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.240
Your Highness.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.280
There's trouble at Yanming Palace.

11:12.360 --> 11:14.360
- Concubine Yan has entered the palace.
- Your Highness!

11:16.360 --> 11:17.800
Your Highness,
there's news from the General's Mansion.

11:17.880 --> 11:18.760
The Crown Princess fainted.

11:23.280 --> 11:27.120
GENERAL'S MANSION

11:27.200 --> 11:30.960
MEMORIAL TABLET OF LADY XUE YUYING
OF THE ZHENG KINGDOM

11:31.040 --> 11:34.640
MEMORIAL TABLET OF MARQUIS OF WUYANG
GENERAL YIN SHENG OF GREAT YAN

11:40.600 --> 11:42.680
MEMORIAL TABLET OF LADY XUE YUYING
OF THE ZHENG KINGDOM

11:42.760 --> 11:44.920
MEMORIAL TABLET OF MARQUIS OF WUYANG
GENERAL YIN SHENG OF GREAT YAN

12:08.680 --> 12:10.840
Jiangtu, leave me be.

12:14.440 --> 12:15.640
It's me.

12:31.480 --> 12:34.520
I went to battle with my father at 15.

12:36.360 --> 12:38.560
I swore to be a righteous person

12:38.640 --> 12:40.600
to protect the people of Great Yan.

12:41.520 --> 12:42.640
But now,

12:44.640 --> 12:46.400
I've killed my own people.

12:52.400 --> 12:55.040
I can't let go of my sense
of righteousness.

12:55.920 --> 12:58.000
Nor can I abandon my feelings for you.

13:00.240 --> 13:01.440
I thought if I closed my eyes,

13:02.440 --> 13:03.760
I wouldn't have to see anything.

13:06.040 --> 13:09.600
But now, when I close my eyes,
I see things even more clearly.

13:14.560 --> 13:17.240
I'm far more cowardly
than I ever imagined.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.880
I wanted to have it all.

13:21.760 --> 13:24.520
But I really don't know how to choose.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.560
If you're still uneasy,

13:29.640 --> 13:31.040
I will stay here and chant scriptures

13:31.560 --> 13:33.320
until your heart is at peace.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.960
May the stains be cleansed

13:50.600 --> 13:52.120
and innocence be revealed.

13:57.560 --> 13:58.800
There are assassins in the palace.

13:58.880 --> 14:01.200
By order of the Eastern Palace,
we are here to protect Your Highness.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.440
What should we do, Chagu?

14:14.640 --> 14:15.480
YANMING PALACE

14:15.560 --> 14:18.240
From now on, Yanming Palace is sealed.

14:18.320 --> 14:21.200
No food or drink shall be delivered.
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.720
With all remedies,

14:31.560 --> 14:32.960
heal the three sufferings.

15:01.280 --> 15:03.520
For the next few days,
I will abstain from killing and meat.

15:05.160 --> 15:07.720
I'll stay here, copying scriptures
to atone for my sins.

15:08.520 --> 15:09.800
Perhaps only by doing this

15:12.360 --> 15:14.640
can I lighten the burden in my heart.

15:17.360 --> 15:21.520
There's no way to have it all.
You must choose me.

15:28.720 --> 15:30.280
The Imperial Guards
have surrounded Yanming Palace.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.880
The Crown Prince has also
put Concubine Yan under house arrest.

15:31.960 --> 15:33.800
It seems her feeding
the Emperor medicine has been exposed.

15:33.880 --> 15:36.840
It's very likely the Emperor
won't make it through tomorrow.

15:44.000 --> 15:44.840
Qingyan,

15:45.560 --> 15:48.480
in the past, I always said
we weren't at a dead end yet.

15:49.880 --> 15:52.960
But this time, we're up against
the elite forces of the Imperial City.

15:54.120 --> 15:55.640
Even if we give it our all,

15:55.720 --> 15:57.440
our chances of victory are slim.

15:58.080 --> 15:59.120
Both of us

15:59.880 --> 16:01.400
must prepare for the worst.

16:03.120 --> 16:05.280
I will follow you to the death, my lord.

16:23.320 --> 16:26.480
MEMORIAL TABLET OF COMMANDER QINGYAN
OF THE WEIBEI ARMY OF GREAT YAN

16:29.720 --> 16:33.640
MEMORIAL TABLET OF GENERAL MURONG JINGHE
OF THE WEIBEI ARMY OF GREAT YAN

16:37.240 --> 16:38.400
Gather everyone.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.320
We will storm the city
and save the Emperor.

16:41.080 --> 16:42.240
Yes.

17:14.560 --> 17:16.000
Seeing you with all these wounds,

17:17.720 --> 17:21.119
your mother would be heartbroken.

17:34.080 --> 17:35.160
I know

17:36.480 --> 17:37.680
you would say

17:39.920 --> 17:41.160
you're not afraid of pain

17:42.960 --> 17:44.120
nor of death.

17:48.080 --> 17:49.400
I also know

17:51.080 --> 17:52.920
that if I asked you to risk your life,

17:54.440 --> 17:56.600
you'd do it without hesitation.

18:01.840 --> 18:02.920
You always say

18:04.520 --> 18:07.200
you want revenge
for the innocent people of Qingzhou.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.360
But you've forgotten

18:12.720 --> 18:14.200
that you, too, are innocent.

18:18.600 --> 18:20.000
You've forgotten how to cry

18:21.480 --> 18:22.800
and how to feel pain.

18:24.840 --> 18:27.520
You gave it your all to stand before me.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.080
How can I

18:35.160 --> 18:37.000
drag you down a second time?

18:55.760 --> 18:57.600
If you want the Snow Dragon Whisker,

18:57.680 --> 18:59.160
what will you trade for it?

18:59.920 --> 19:01.560
I will write a confession,

19:02.400 --> 19:04.440
admitting I colluded with Liu Zhong,

19:04.520 --> 19:06.080
plotted to kill Father,

19:06.160 --> 19:07.800
and attempted to assassinate
the Crown Prince.

19:07.880 --> 19:09.440
I will admit it was all my doing.

19:10.640 --> 19:11.480
That way,

19:12.560 --> 19:16.000
you can ascend the throne
with a clean slate.

19:17.360 --> 19:19.560
I want you to confess to the world.

19:21.720 --> 19:24.360
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

19:25.560 --> 19:28.120
Convince me why I should
trust you to protect her.

19:28.880 --> 19:30.120
I am the Prince Heir of Xiyan

19:30.920 --> 19:32.880
with an imperial edict
from the Emperor to marry her.

19:33.480 --> 19:36.000
And I vow to protect her with my life.

19:44.440 --> 19:46.360
You can save her,
but she won't be your wife.

19:47.880 --> 19:50.680
In your current situation,
is there a better option?

19:51.520 --> 19:52.880
You and the Crown Prince
will inevitably clash.

19:53.480 --> 19:55.760
If you lose, even if she escapes to Xiyan,

19:55.840 --> 19:57.440
the Crown Prince will not spare her.

19:57.520 --> 20:00.880
Only as the Princess Heir of Xiyan
can she truly be safe.

20:02.040 --> 20:05.000
She would never trade her freedom
for survival.

20:08.800 --> 20:11.280
By the gods above, I, Yue Qin, swear

20:11.360 --> 20:13.600
I will never force Mei Lin
into anything against her will.

20:14.200 --> 20:16.360
If I break this vow,
may everything I desire

20:16.440 --> 20:17.760
be forever denied.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.680
These are Snow Dragon Whisker seeds.

20:29.760 --> 20:31.880
The Momai poison in her body
hasn't been neutralized yet.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.000
Only the Snow Dragon Whisker can save her.

21:10.320 --> 21:11.280
I'm sorry.

21:13.520 --> 21:15.440
This time, the choice isn't yours to make.

21:26.400 --> 21:27.400
Jinghe.

22:32.960 --> 22:34.680
MEMORIAL TABLET OF GENERAL MURONG JINGHE
OF THE WEIBEI ARMY OF GREAT YAN

22:38.680 --> 22:39.880
Mei Lin.

22:57.240 --> 22:58.800
Master of the Shadow Works.

23:00.760 --> 23:02.120
Mei Lin,

23:02.200 --> 23:04.760
infiltrate the peace-making
marriage delegation of Xiyan

23:04.840 --> 23:07.640
and assassinate
the Third Prince of Great Yan,

23:08.240 --> 23:09.920
Murong Jinghe.

23:30.560 --> 23:31.800
It's you.

23:47.000 --> 23:47.960
That's right.

23:48.640 --> 23:50.920
The Master of the Shadow Works

23:51.000 --> 23:52.320
is me.

23:57.480 --> 23:58.440
No,

24:01.640 --> 24:02.880
it can't be you.

24:05.600 --> 24:07.120
It can't be you.

24:08.640 --> 24:09.840
Little beggar,

24:11.160 --> 24:15.000
from the moment you tried
to assassinate me ten years ago,

24:16.080 --> 24:19.120
you became my dead piece.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.240
The attempted assassination in the court

24:22.840 --> 24:24.440
and the Momai poison

24:25.160 --> 24:28.600
were both traps I set for you.

24:35.000 --> 24:36.920
Had it not been for the token,

24:37.640 --> 24:41.160
I would never have gotten you
out of the Imperial Prison.

24:41.960 --> 24:43.640
I cooperated with you

24:44.240 --> 24:48.120
only because
you knew the whereabouts of Zhang Yin.

24:51.640 --> 24:54.440
You may be a disobedient pawn,

24:57.720 --> 25:00.160
but you're still a useful blade.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.680
It's always been

25:04.760 --> 25:05.680
just an act

25:05.760 --> 25:09.040
between you and me.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.080
An act?

25:18.800 --> 25:19.640
Yes.

25:21.600 --> 25:23.440
From beginning to end,

25:24.160 --> 25:26.560
it was all just an act.

25:27.800 --> 25:31.760
I would never fall in love with a pawn.

25:32.480 --> 25:34.760
If the ambush in Laowozi Village
hadn't seemed so real,

25:34.840 --> 25:38.720
how would you have
willingly let me use you?

25:39.440 --> 25:40.800
I never expected

25:42.120 --> 25:44.480
you'd get so caught up in the act

25:44.560 --> 25:46.880
and actually fall in love with me.

25:55.000 --> 25:55.960
Jinghe,

25:56.840 --> 25:58.320
you're lying to me.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.080
You're lying again.

26:08.600 --> 26:09.800
Lying to you?

26:11.320 --> 26:13.240
At this point,

26:13.320 --> 26:14.280
what's the point

26:15.400 --> 26:17.160
of lying to you?

26:22.320 --> 26:24.280
One more thing.

26:25.000 --> 26:27.720
Your sweating isn't caused by the heat.

26:28.520 --> 26:31.000
It's because the Momai poison in you

26:31.600 --> 26:33.320
was never neutralized.

26:35.360 --> 26:36.760
Now,

26:38.360 --> 26:41.040
you only have a few months left to live.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.480
Mei Lin,

26:48.600 --> 26:50.640
your end is near.

26:52.400 --> 26:54.960
Since you love me so deeply,

26:56.600 --> 26:57.640
why not

26:58.920 --> 27:02.080
do one last thing for me?

27:06.920 --> 27:08.400
Little beggar,

27:08.480 --> 27:12.120
staying alive is the real torture.

27:23.280 --> 27:25.440
Die for me.

27:34.480 --> 27:35.600
Let's go!

27:53.800 --> 27:56.080
I'll be holding onto your hairpin for now.

27:56.960 --> 27:59.160
Once we've taken down the Crown Prince,

27:59.240 --> 28:01.040
I'll give it back to you.

28:01.120 --> 28:04.720
If you want to talk to your mother,
come to me.

28:04.800 --> 28:06.360
However, the Lancang River
is too far away.

28:07.120 --> 28:10.000
So, I moved the blue starry river here
for you.

28:11.680 --> 28:14.960
I want you to see
the most beautiful scenery

28:15.040 --> 28:16.280
I've ever seen.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.920
Is what you just said true?

28:27.000 --> 28:30.240
Are you willing to take me, Murong Jinghe,

28:30.960 --> 28:31.960
as your live-in husband?

28:34.600 --> 28:35.640
Let's make a bet.

28:35.720 --> 28:37.400
If I can grow Red Fruits,

28:38.160 --> 28:39.000
you will marry me.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.120
You…!

28:56.440 --> 28:58.400
Keep my hairpin well.

28:59.200 --> 29:00.480
If it gets even slightly damaged,

29:01.080 --> 29:02.280
you'll have to spend your life
making it up to me.

29:04.000 --> 29:08.080
How dare you compare me to a dog?

29:08.160 --> 29:10.600
That dog was my only companion

29:10.680 --> 29:12.160
after the fire in Qingzhou.

29:20.080 --> 29:23.600
A pawn can never be a winner.

29:24.440 --> 29:27.800
All I wanted was justice for the innocent.

29:38.080 --> 29:40.600
Forgive me, but I can't work
with you anymore, my lord.

29:49.640 --> 29:52.920
Qingzhou. The true culprit is not dead.

29:53.760 --> 29:55.280
You are not qualified to sleep.

29:56.120 --> 29:57.400
Get up.

29:59.480 --> 30:00.480
Jinghe.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.880
Mei Lin, you must live.

30:26.960 --> 30:32.160
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

31:01.920 --> 31:04.360
Capture the rebels!
No one may enter or leave!

31:14.120 --> 31:16.040
He did it to save me.

31:20.040 --> 31:21.320
Stop the carriage.

31:23.320 --> 31:24.240
Stop the carriage!

32:03.920 --> 32:05.760
Mei Lin, don't blame me.

32:06.800 --> 32:09.840
This is the only way
to get you out of here.

32:25.680 --> 32:29.480
PRINCE JING'S MANSION

32:47.040 --> 32:49.760
Traitor Murong Jinghe
colluded with Liu Zhong,

32:49.840 --> 32:51.440
attempted to assassinate the Crown Prince,

32:51.520 --> 32:53.000
and conspired to incite rebellion.

32:53.080 --> 32:54.960
These crimes warrant execution.

32:55.040 --> 32:56.720
He will be executed at the Wu hour.

32:58.520 --> 33:02.280
The mighty General Weibei
Is fierce and bold

33:02.360 --> 33:05.920
His glory and power
Are built on bloodshed and cold

33:06.000 --> 33:09.560
In the living world
This mass murderer roams

33:09.640 --> 33:13.400
In the underworld
Thousands of Qingzhou ghosts weep

33:13.480 --> 33:17.040
His heart has hardened like eyes of steel

33:17.120 --> 33:20.920
Sever his head and send him
To the underworld

33:21.000 --> 33:24.840
Flesh devoured, blood drunk, bones crushed

33:24.920 --> 33:28.600
The mass murderer
Will be cursed for millennia

33:31.120 --> 33:32.360
Did you hear?

33:34.120 --> 33:38.200
Killing you is what the people want.

33:39.680 --> 33:43.600
The people want
the real mass murderer dead.

33:44.760 --> 33:46.320
Their will is unyielding,

33:46.880 --> 33:48.480
and the truth
will eventually come to light.

33:48.560 --> 33:51.640
This truth was written by your own hand.

33:52.680 --> 33:55.360
Murong Jinghe,
do you admit to your crimes?

33:55.960 --> 33:56.840
I do.

34:03.960 --> 34:07.080
Considering you're of royal blood
and blessed by Heaven,

34:07.800 --> 34:11.440
confess your crimes before your ancestors.

34:12.920 --> 34:14.239
With Heaven above

34:14.880 --> 34:16.280
and Earth below,

34:16.840 --> 34:18.239
the Murong clan,

34:18.320 --> 34:19.960
ordained by Heaven's decree,

34:20.040 --> 34:21.760
governs the people.

34:21.840 --> 34:24.880
With ancestors honored,
the nation has prospered.

34:25.840 --> 34:28.719
But now, an unfilial descendant of Murong,

34:28.800 --> 34:30.360
driven by selfish ambition,

34:30.440 --> 34:31.800
has cast aside the ancestors' teachings

34:32.400 --> 34:34.320
and committed three unforgivable crimes.

34:34.920 --> 34:38.000
First, he failed the Emperor, his father,

34:38.639 --> 34:41.239
by plotting treason
against his own family.

34:41.320 --> 34:42.920
This makes him unfilial.

34:43.000 --> 34:45.840
Second, as a prince,

34:45.920 --> 34:47.719
he disregarded the people's welfare

34:47.800 --> 34:50.440
and caused the deaths
of hundreds of thousands in Qingzhou.

34:50.520 --> 34:52.280
This makes him unjust.

34:52.360 --> 34:55.320
Third, he betrayed the bond of kinship

34:55.400 --> 34:58.040
by bringing harm to his own brother.

34:58.120 --> 34:59.680
This makes him disloyal.

34:59.760 --> 35:02.760
Such unfiliality, injustice,
and disloyalty

35:03.560 --> 35:06.320
make him unworthy to face
his ancestors or serve the nation.

35:09.560 --> 35:10.400
Jinghe,

35:12.080 --> 35:13.600
take your own life

35:15.760 --> 35:17.320
to repay the world.

35:31.960 --> 35:34.200
I attempted
to assassinate the Crown Prince,

35:34.280 --> 35:36.160
not out of greed for the throne

35:36.240 --> 35:37.800
but to rid the nation of evil.

35:39.240 --> 35:41.040
The one guilty of being unfilial,

35:41.120 --> 35:42.520
unjust,

35:42.600 --> 35:45.760
and disloyal is none other
than the Crown Prince,

35:46.440 --> 35:48.000
Murong Xuanlie.

35:48.600 --> 35:49.920
Do you admit to your crimes?

36:00.160 --> 36:01.120
Protect the Crown Prince!

36:04.480 --> 36:05.320
My lord.

36:08.600 --> 36:09.440
Go to Yanming Palace.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.480
Murong Jinghe has rebelled.

36:18.560 --> 36:19.560
Execute him on the spot!

36:19.640 --> 36:21.720
Wang Quan,
take your men to guard Yanming Palace.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.000
Yes.

36:34.640 --> 36:36.040
The Imperial Guards
outnumber us several times.

36:36.680 --> 36:39.800
Avoid direct confrontation
before we reach Yanming Palace.

36:44.840 --> 36:45.960
When the battle drums sound,

36:46.680 --> 36:48.800
a soldier must fight and never retreat
until the drums fall silent.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.560
As long as she still remembers
the sound of the battle drums,

36:51.640 --> 36:54.080
she will remember the duty of a general.

36:55.640 --> 36:57.640
If we can win General Yin's support,

36:57.720 --> 37:00.400
we will have a better chance of survival.

37:07.640 --> 37:09.600
When the battle drums sound,

37:09.680 --> 37:12.320
a soldier must fight and never retreat
until the drums fall silent.

37:26.560 --> 37:28.320
The Yin family has always
been loyal and brave.

37:28.400 --> 37:30.520
At this critical moment for Great Yan,

37:30.600 --> 37:34.560
I hope you can act decisively
and turn the situation around.

37:34.640 --> 37:36.120
MEMORIAL TABLET OF LADY XUE YUYING
OF THE ZHENG KINGDOM

37:36.200 --> 37:38.000
MEMORIAL TABLET OF MARQUIS OF WUYANG
GENERAL YIN SHENG OF GREAT YAN

37:38.840 --> 37:40.680
Will the legacy of the Yin family

37:41.880 --> 37:44.000
really end in my hands?

37:51.640 --> 37:53.640
You're so clever, honey.

37:53.720 --> 37:55.680
Father, your hands are so rough.

38:00.840 --> 38:01.880
I forgot.

38:04.240 --> 38:08.040
Mother said you held Great Yan
in the palm of your hands

38:08.120 --> 38:09.240
and that's why they grew calluses.

38:09.320 --> 38:10.680
Great Yan is so vast.

38:10.760 --> 38:14.320
You can leave
some of it in my hands, Father.

38:15.280 --> 38:17.360
Very well.

38:18.440 --> 38:22.000
When you grow up and become a general,

38:22.080 --> 38:24.600
I'll entrust some of it to you.

38:27.560 --> 38:29.240
What a good child.

38:31.320 --> 38:33.080
Peeking at the military drill?

38:33.160 --> 38:34.280
Using the targets without permission?

38:34.360 --> 38:35.320
Do you still not see your mistakes?

38:37.000 --> 38:39.680
Father, do you also despise me
for being a girl?

38:39.760 --> 38:41.880
Have you forgotten the promise
you made to me when I was a child?

38:41.960 --> 38:44.640
I thought it was just idle talk.

38:47.240 --> 38:48.360
Luomei,

38:50.080 --> 38:51.560
I gave my life to the battlefield

38:51.640 --> 38:53.960
and wronged both you and your mother.

38:54.800 --> 38:57.280
I don't want you to follow my path.

38:57.360 --> 38:59.760
I never felt wronged as a child

39:01.000 --> 39:04.920
because I knew
you held the safety of Great Yan

39:05.000 --> 39:07.640
in your hands
and were the backbone of the nation.

39:08.840 --> 39:11.640
But now, kneeling before you,

39:11.720 --> 39:13.360
I feel wronged.

39:13.440 --> 39:16.480
I never wanted to walk your path.

39:17.640 --> 39:20.000
I only want to walk the one I chose!

39:38.520 --> 39:39.600
Does it hurt?

39:40.480 --> 39:43.080
I lanced it so it can heal faster.

39:51.280 --> 39:52.360
At the Mao hour, the drill begins.

39:52.440 --> 39:54.800
Anyone late will receive five strikes.

39:57.200 --> 39:58.640
Have you agreed to let me
become a general?

39:59.320 --> 40:00.160
My daughter,

40:01.800 --> 40:03.400
when the calluses on your hands

40:04.200 --> 40:05.520
are as thick as mine,

40:05.600 --> 40:07.560
you will be qualified

40:07.640 --> 40:09.600
to become a general to protect the nation.

40:10.360 --> 40:12.120
Since you've chosen this path,

40:12.920 --> 40:16.120
do not betray the Emperor's trust,

40:17.120 --> 40:18.680
the people's hopes,

40:19.640 --> 40:21.640
and my support.

40:23.880 --> 40:24.960
I understand, Father.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.680
Father,

40:38.440 --> 40:40.240
now the calluses on my hands

40:41.320 --> 40:43.040
are already thicker than yours.

40:55.400 --> 40:57.320
YANMING PALACE

40:57.400 --> 40:58.600
The guards at Yanming Palace

40:58.680 --> 41:01.360
are all the Crown Prince's elite forces.

41:02.240 --> 41:04.080
We can only fight our way in.

41:17.720 --> 41:18.600
Kill him!

41:19.240 --> 41:23.720
Charge!
